==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|electronics}} A flat board that holds [[chip]]s and other [[electronic]] [[component]]s in [[layer]]s that [[interconnect]] via [[copper]] [[pathway]]s, often called [[trace]]s.

